  "description": "Omega AI — Local AI LLM Chat\n\nOmega AI is a private local AI assistant for iPhone—built for people who search for local AI, LLM, AIS, offline AI, and locally hosted AI workflows in one place. It runs on-device LLM inference in a familiar chat layout: add a compatible GGUF model and keep everyday chats offline, with no cloud processing of your prompts in normal use.\n\nWhy Omega AI?\n\n• Local AI & LLM — answers run on your phone using the model you import. Compare local LLM setups, tune prompts, and iterate without sending thread text to remote servers by default.\n• Ollama-style GGUF — import weights you are licensed to use and that comply with each publisher’s terms. Omega AI is not the Ollama server app; it is an iPhone local LLM chat experience aligned with the GGUF ecosystem many desktop local AI tools support.\n• Private by design — threads stay on device for privacy-first users who want offline AI after models are downloaded.\n• Productivity & creative writing — notes, rewriting, study outlines, planning, and an AI story generator–style workflow for drafts and brainstorming (output quality depends on the model you load).\n• No subscriptions — simple access without monthly fees tied to cloud APIs.\n• Lightweight inference — tuned for typical iPhones (you still need storage for model files).\n\nHow it works\n\nDownload Omega AI from the App Store.\nImport a compatible GGUF model you have rights to use.\nStart chatting: your LLM runs locally for local AI conversations.\n\nIdeal for\n\n• Anyone researching local AI, LLM, offline AI, and on-device assistant apps that keep data on the phone\n• Writers who want an AI story generator–like flow without sending drafts to the cloud\n• People who maintain several models (sometimes called an LLM farm) and want one place to chat on iPhone\n• Students and professionals exploring ideas with a private on-device LLM\n\nRequirements\n\n• iPhone or iPad with enough free storage for GGUF models\n• Model files the app supports (see in-app guidance)\n\nOmega AI is intended for lawful, appropriate use—schoolwork, journaling, productivity, and creative projects you manage yourself. If you care about offline LLM use, GGUF compatibility, and keeping local AI chat on your device, download Omega AI and try local LLM chat today.",
